--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Exercise 11 - Identifying Job Titles with Missing Annual Salary Information

Business Problem:
The HR Director noticed that many job postings do not
include an annual salary. Before implementing a policy requiring salary 
transparency, the team wants to identify which job titles most
frequently omit annual salary information.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SELECT job_title_short
      , COUNT(*) AS Missing_Salary_Postings
FROM job_postings_fact
WHERE salary_year_avg IS NULL
GROUP BY job_title_short
ORDER BY Missing_Salary_Postings DESC;

-- Business Insight: Data Analyst is among the top job titles with the 
highest number of postings missing annual salary information.
